@startuml DFD_Level0_Context
title DFD Level 0 / Context Diagram - Sistem Absensi Karyawan Berbasis IoT (RFID)

skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #3498DB
  BorderColor #2980B9
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 14
  FontStyle bold
  RoundCorner 0
}

skinparam card {
  BackgroundColor #2ECC71
  BorderColor #27AE60
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 15
  FontStyle bold
  RoundCorner 30
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #333333
  FontSize 11
  FontColor #333333
}

hide footbox

rectangle "Admin\n(Pengelola Sistem)" as admin
rectangle "Device RFID\n(Perangkat IoT)" as device

card "  0\nSistem Absensi\nBerbasis IoT  " as sistem

admin -down-> sistem : **Data Master, Data Absensi Manual, Request Laporan**
sistem -up-> admin : **Info Login, Data Master, Laporan Absensi**

device -left-> sistem : **Data Scan RFID (UID + Waktu)**
sistem -right-> device : **Notifikasi Hasil Absensi**

legend bottom left
  |= Warna |= Keterangan |
  | <#3498DB> | Entitas Eksternal (Admin, Device RFID) |
  | <#2ECC71> | Proses Tunggal (Sistem) |
  | Panah | Aliran Data |
endlegend

@enduml